            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "cquinn74"
            },
            "reviewBody": "So so easy! As suggested in other reviews, used a Turkey bag, added fresh garlic and whole cloves to broth. This ham was moister and tastier than any other ham we’ve had. Three days later, my husband is still saying how good the ham was! It was savory not sweet. We’ll definitely make this again!",
